            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "greenhouse"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this the day before and it marinated overnight. It was great the next day. I made it when mangos were a little out of season, so two of my mangos were not real sweet, kind of tart. So I added sugar to the tart ones and that seemed to help without creating watery juice. I'm still eating it 5 days later and it's still wonderful. Everyone at the party loved it, even my husband who doesn't like sweet dips.",
            "datePublished": "2009-03-16T06:45:59.313Z"
          },
